From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mitzev <ogi@kunasystems.com>
Date: Tue, 21 Apr 2026 23:24:03 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Codegen: vtable emission + ctor vptr-init + extern C++/Swift
 call lowering

rustc_codegen_llvm gains a cxx_vtable module that emits _ZTV / _ZTI /
_ZTS globals and walks inheritance chains to combine base + derived
virtuals. MIR codegen grows a return-terminator hook that writes each
class's vptr right before function return (required for derived ctors
where the user body assigns a base subobject after entry). Call
lowering threads extern "C++" and extern "Swift" through the matching
calling convention attributes.
